          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>To evaluate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 31^2,]</span> we start by writing it out with a multiplication sign:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2]</span></p><p>Then, we work out <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 31 \\times 31.]</span></p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3|1; \u00d7|0|0|3|1; 3|1; +|9|3|0; 9|6|1]</span></p><p>Therefore, <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 31 \\times 31 =   961.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "To evaluate [MATH: 31^2,] we start by writing it out with a multiplication sign:\n[MATH: 2]\n\nThen, we work out [MATH: 31 \\times 31.]\n\n[MATH: 3|1; \u00d7|0|0|3|1; 3|1; +|9|3|0; 9|6|1]\n\nTherefore, [MATH: 31 \\times 31 = 961.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
