        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nEvaluate [MATH: 31^2.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nTo evaluate [MATH: 31^2,] we start by writing it out with a multiplication sign:\n[MATH: 2]\n\nThen, we work out [MATH: 31 \\times 31.]\n\n[MATH: 3|1; \u00d7|0|0|3|1; 3|1; +|9|3|0; 9|6|1]\n\nTherefore, [MATH: 31 \\times 31 = 961.]"
